			"height": 230,
			"text": "**How to read this map**\n\nArrows point from the caller or sender to what it reaches. Two heads mean data flows both ways, and purple arrows are API calls.\n\nCards: cyan is the place to start, orange is a next task, yellow is work in progress, red needs a refactor.\n\nIf a card says its file is missing, open `docs/brain/` as the vault."
		}
